+## CI visibility during queued runs (verified 2026-09-29)
+
+A workflow run can exist before its job appears in a PR's `statusCheckRollup`.
+During CP53 N12, the runtime-capacity check appeared later on the same head after
+an initial rollup showed only four checks. Absence from that first list did not
+mean path filtering had excluded the workflow. Check run-level state when a job
+is missing, keep the provider watcher bounded, and compare the final complete
+check set against the exact head before calling CI green. Do not infer the
+workflow's trigger behavior solely from the last commit's file list.
